From eed375bed6cb2b97a3ff71db49e6d38a53153117 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SP11 Linux Project <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:39:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/47] ASoC: qcom: q6apm: port SP11 soft-pause lifecycle

Adapt the accepted Windows soft-pause lifecycle to Linux v7.3 generic
push/pull support. Register exact DSP pause/resume completion events and
quiesce watermark callbacks before pause. Use the validated 3840-byte
protected pull ring without reviving the older private pull-mode code.

Signed-off-by: SP11 Linux Project <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
---
